From 03edc7cd63d7d8994f6593f88cb4f7cdff4c392b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dolbaras <dolbaras@localhost>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 10:04:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] android: hardware decoders and a texture for them

setCodecInfo() dropped every decoder, and before Android 10 it treated
only a fixed list of vendors as hardware, so OMX.amlogic.* and other TV
box decoders were never found. Keep the decoders and, before Android 10,
count a decoder that is not a known software one as hardware.

Add create_video_texture / release_video_texture: a SurfaceTexture entry
of the Flutter engine whose Surface is handed to the Rust side
(FFI.setVideoSurface) for the hardware decoder to render into.
---
 .../com/carriez/flutter_hbb/MainActivity.kt   | 56 ++++++++++++++++++-
 flutter/android/app/src/main/kotlin/ffi.kt    |  3 +
 2 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/flutter/android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/carriez/flutter_hbb/MainActivity.kt b/flutter/android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/carriez/flutter_hbb/MainActivity.kt
